  <section class="coda">
    <h3><em>Or let it</em> build itself</h3>
    <p>
      Every piece above is a field you can fill in yourself. Builder mode is the other way round:
      you describe the goal, and the agent configures its own core, prompt, skills and schedule.
    </p>
